      "id": 100,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Scene OCR Service Monitoring\n\nThis dashboard monitors the Scene OCR feature which extracts text from security camera frames to identify service providers (delivery trucks, utility vehicles, etc.).\n\n**Processing Modes:**\n- **Full Frame**: OCR on complete frame for scene context (signs, house numbers)\n- **Crop**: OCR on detection crops for object-specific text (uniforms, vehicle markings)\n\n**Service Categories:** DELIVERY, UTILITY, TELECOM, PLUMBING, HVAC, ELECTRICAL, LANDSCAPING, PEST_CONTROL, MEDICAL, SECURITY, FOOD_DELIVERY"
      },
      "title": "Documentation",
      "type": "text"
    },
